<span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.8144em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="overline-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∨</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2em; vertical-align: -0.35em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">(</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">==</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">b</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∧</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2em; vertical-align: -0.35em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">2..0</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">b</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mbin mtight">−</span><span class="mord mtight">2..0</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="delimsizing size1">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2866" data-end="2908">Gate construction (per bit from MSB down):</p>
<ol data-start="2909" data-end="3089">
<li data-start="2909" data-end="2962">
<p data-start="2912" data-end="2962">For bit <code data-start="2920" data-end="2923">i</code> compute <code data-start="2932" data-end="2961">a_i_and_not_bi = a_i ∧ ¬b_i</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2963" data-end="3017">
<p data-start="2966" data-end="3017">Compute <code data-start="2974" data-end="3000">equal_i = XNOR(a_i, b_i)</code> (use EQ recipe).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3018" data-end="3089">
<p data-start="3021" data-end="3089">Recursively combine: <code data-start="3042" data-end="3088">GT_i = a_i_and_not_bi ∨ (equal_i ∧ GT_{i-1})</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<ul data-start="3091" data-end="3254">
<li data-start="3091" data-end="3138">
<p data-start="3093" data-end="3138">Implement each AND/OR/XNOR with NAND recipes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3139" data-end="3254">
<p data-start="3141" data-end="3254">Depth: O(w) if serial; you can parallelize with prefix-style carry logic for smaller depth at cost of more gates.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3256" data-end="3363"><strong data-start="3256" data-end="3282">Equality of full words</strong>: compute <code data-start="3292" data-end="3327">EQ_w = ∧_{i=0}^{w-1} (a_i == b_i)</code> (use XNOR per bit then AND-reduce).</p>
<hr data-start="3365" data-end="3368">
<h1 data-start="3370" data-end="3410">5 — Registers / D flip-flop from NANDs</h1>
<p data-start="3412" data-end="3501">You will need edge-triggered D-FFs for pipelining. Standard master–slave D-FF from NANDs:</p>
<p data-start="3503" data-end="3589">Master latch (level-sensitive) using two cross-coupled NAND pairs and gating by clock:</p>
<ul data-start="3590" data-end="3745">
<li data-start="3590" data-end="3682">
<p data-start="3592" data-end="3682">Master: when <code data-start="3605" data-end="3612">CLK=1</code> (for positive-edge-active scheme), master transparent and captures D.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3683" data-end="3745">
<p data-start="3685" data-end="3745">Slave: gated by ~CLK, latches master output on falling edge.</p>
</li>
</ul>
