<ul data-start="4376" data-end="4497">
<li data-start="4376" data-end="4497">
<p data-start="4378" data-end="4497"><strong data-start="4378" data-end="4394">Observation:</strong> recursive structures = pipelined / tree-structured hardware logic generalized to type-level recursion.</p>
</li>
