<hr data-start="4499" data-end="4502">
<h1 data-start="4504" data-end="4552"><strong data-start="4506" data-end="4552">Stage 6 — Full Coq/Lean kernel abstraction</strong></h1>
<ul data-start="4553" data-end="5133">
<li data-start="4553" data-end="4778">
<p data-start="4555" data-end="4587"><strong data-start="4555" data-end="4585">Primitive building blocks:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="4590" data-end="4778">
<li data-start="4590" data-end="4620">
<p data-start="4592" data-end="4620">Universe <code data-start="4601" data-end="4609">Type_0</code> (atomic)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4623" data-end="4659">
<p data-start="4625" data-end="4659">Π and Σ (function/product types)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4662" data-end="4723">
<p data-start="4664" data-end="4723">Inductive definitions (constructors → “hardware routing”)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4726" data-end="4778">
<p data-start="4728" data-end="4778">Elimination rules (pattern matching → branching)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="4780" data-end="5002">
<p data-start="4782" data-end="4844"><strong data-start="4782" data-end="4803">Kernel operation:</strong> type checking = “simulator” for logic:</p>
<ul data-start="4847" data-end="5002">
<li data-start="4847" data-end="4910">
<p data-start="4849" data-end="4910"><code data-start="4849" data-end="4859">A : Type</code>, <code data-start="4861" data-end="4868">t : A</code> → t inhabits type A (proof correctness)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4913" data-end="5002">
<p data-start="4915" data-end="5002">Compositionality ensures soundness (like verifying pipeline correctness in hardware).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="5004" data-end="5133">
<p data-start="5006" data-end="5133"><strong data-start="5006" data-end="5018">Analogy:</strong> NAND simulator → HDL → gates → combinational logic → pipelined multi-bit MUX → type system checker → proof kernel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5135" data-end="5138">
