25" data-end="44">Plato’s Academy</strong>. The famous inscription associated with it is:</p>
<p data-start="93" data-end="147"><strong data-start="93" data-end="122">“Μηδὲν ἄγαν” (Mēdèn ágan)</strong> — usually translated as:</p>
<p data-start="149" data-end="201"><strong data-start="149" data-end="172">“Nothing in excess”</strong> or <strong data-start="176" data-end="199">“Nothing too much.”</strong></p>
<ul data-start="203" data-end="456">
<li data-start="203" data-end="289">
<p data-start="205" data-end="289">This was a Delphic maxim, reflecting the Greek emphasis on moderation and balance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="290" data-end="456">
<p data-start="292" data-end="456">Plato reportedly had it inscribed at the entrance to the Academy, signaling that the pursuit of knowledge and virtue should be guided by moderation, not extremes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="458" data-end="616">Some sources also mention <strong data-start="484" data-end="516">“Let none uninitiated enter”</strong> or variations of that, but the maxim <strong data-start="554" data-end="577">“Nothing in excess”</strong> is the most famous and widely cited.</p>
<p data-start="618" data-end="766">It’s both literal (a caution against hubris or overreach) and philosophical, reflecting the Academy’s aim to cultivate reasoned, balanced inquiry.</p>
<p data-start="768" data-end="898" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want, I can give a <strong data-start="794" data-end="897">brief overview of all the maxims or inscriptions associated with Plato’s Academy and their meanings</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.1659